OL,3,GNEWSAPrison nurse struck off over
OL,4,Asmuggling drugs into jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison nurse who was jailed over a
OL,7,Fdrug smuggling operation has been
OL,8,Fstruck off.
OL,10,FA Nursing and Midwifery Council (NMC)
OL,11,Fhearing was told Keira Burton had been
OL,12,Fconvicted for her role in smuggling
OL,13,Fcannabis, spice, ketamine, phones and
OL,14,FSIM cards into HMP Preston and jailed
OL,15,Ffor 20 months in March 2025.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
