OL,3,GNEWSAPrison nurse struck off over
OL,4,Asmuggling drugs into jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fitness to practise panel concluded
OL,7,FBurton's actions represented a
OL,8,Fsignificant departure from the
OL,9,Fstandards expected of a registered
OL,10,Fnurse and were fundamentally
OL,11,Fincompatible with her remaining on the
OL,12,Fregister.
OL,14,FShe said she "fully accepted" that she
OL,15,Fhad "lost a career that I loved and
OL,16,Fworked extremely hard for, for many
OL,17,Fyears".
